From: 77450danik <dnsystems@email.ua>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] explorer: The chevron, and the system's icons at the right.

As in Windows 10 and 11 a program's icon goes behind a chevron, which
is always there and whose flyout has the look of the taskbar's style. An
icon is dragged there and back and among the others; network, sound and
power stay at the right, in that order.
---
diff --git a/base/shell/explorer/syspager.cpp b/base/shell/explorer/syspager.cpp
index 6b9cb36..b62e5a9 100644
--- a/base/shell/explorer/syspager.cpp
+++ b/base/shell/explorer/syspager.cpp
